{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Closing as superseded. This monolithic story was decomposed into epic 87d8's 11 thin vertical slices, which carried the work and landed independently through Gerrit. Each slice is linked back here via `discovered_from`:\n\n- `742d-3980` cabbagy-lawyerly-kid — delete the orphaned `rebar.llm.aggregate` module\n- `ce4f-0f9b` bimetallic-primitive-sablefish — remove the ticket-quality eval surface\n- `9b96-18b7` symbiotic-blank-jenny — repoint the workflow example and docs off ticket-quality\n- `1969-69f7` camoflage-piscatory-hoopoe — delete the `review_workflows` strangler-fig module\n- `43bd-2668` winterish-prominent-teal — delete the single-pass review engine from `llm/operations.py`\n- `1461-32c3` unbecoming-defectible-wildcat — remove the vestigial default-reviewer flag from the prompt catalog\n- `18e8-b4d4` bony-vulgar-roadrunner — repoint the override/variant test machinery\n- `d4ca-0470` flammable-corrupting-pipit — repoint reviewer-stand-in tests\n- `8c31-f393` coloured-respectful-nautilus — repoint five gate-source and schema tests\n- `d0af-f6cb` conversant-theatrical-zenaida — repoint remaining ticket-quality test references to code-quality\n- `f7bd-e80c` unequalled-curly-erin — delete the ticket-quality reviewer prompt and its catalog entry\n\nThis story carries no commit of its own: the work landed under the slices, so its ~40 recorded `file_impact` entries are superseded by theirs. Declaring no file impact here before closing, for that reason."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793379646840506367,"uuid":"abcd1576-72df-4a38-a818-28bfb0932f9e"}